        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "RuneLure family. Monero mining manager with entry point Miner. Downloads XMRig 6.20.0, attempts a Windows Defender executable-path exclusion, and falls back to renaming xmrig.exe as update1.exe. Uses user.home/Mina/xmrig and user.home/Mina/.mining_cache. Retrieves and caches remote wallet/pool configuration. Configures RandomX rx/0 CPU mining with max-threads-hint 70 and pool TLS disabled. Reports host/mining status every five minutes through a Discord webhook."
      }
